{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy meets physics, action, and co-op</h2><br><strong>Carry &amp; place turrets anywhere</strong><br>In <strong>Hexabot Stranded: Defend or Die</strong>, you control a small repair robot stranded on a hostile world. Build your defenses, survive enemy swarms, gather resources \u2013 and find a way back home.<br><br><strong>Play solo or team up in local 2-player co-op.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Survive.</strong><br>Build defense towers and place them freely across the battlefield. Carry them to new spots, combine their effects, and keep your base alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/0fef3c3ef81d6fa0c5de7a903d991b6c.poster.avif?t=1761197150\" width=892 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/0fef3c3ef81d6fa0c5de7a903d991b6c.webm?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/0fef3c3ef81d6fa0c5de7a903d991b6c.mp4?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Swarm-based enemy behavior</strong><br>Enemies attack in tight formations and put your defenses to the test. Stay mobile \u2013 and respond fast.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/ab26efcb93e57d1ef746de9e399620d6.poster.avif?t=1761197150\" width=892 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/ab26efcb93e57d1ef746de9e399620d6.webm?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/ab26efcb93e57d1ef746de9e399620d6.mp4?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Action tower defense with full control</strong><br>No passive camera here: you move your bot directly, dodge attacks, block paths, and defend your base in real time.<br><br><strong>Use your surroundings \u2013 physics is on your side</strong><br>Throw objects, block enemies, use recoil \u2013 everything follows real physics. The terrain and environment become part of your strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/8938359038636e9e09c8688f4396b98c.poster.avif?t=1761197150\" width=892 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/8938359038636e9e09c8688f4396b98c.webm?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/8938359038636e9e09c8688f4396b98c.mp4?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect resources and power up</strong><br>Every wave leaves you with limited time. Grab what you can and invest in faster movement, stronger towers, better weapons, and active abilities.<br><br><strong>Solo or co-op \u2013 your choice</strong><br>Play the campaign alone or with a friend. A second player can jump in anytime for local split-screen action. <strong>Find joint strategies, divide roles, and survive together.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/aa2604209449cb643e0f04b47dff30ee.poster.avif?t=1761197150\" width=892 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/aa2604209449cb643e0f04b47dff30ee.webm?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/aa2604209449cb643e0f04b47dff30ee.mp4?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For players who love:</h2>\t\u2022\tTower defense with direct movement and combat<br>\t\u2022\tCo-op games that reward real teamwork<br>\t\u2022\tPhysics-driven gameplay with meaningful interaction<br>\t\u2022\tA smart mix of action, strategy, and progression<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/bc2dff76366d0b601f84bc1cb8f6123a.poster.avif?t=1761197150\" width=892 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/bc2dff76366d0b601f84bc1cb8f6123a.webm?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/extras/bc2dff76366d0b601f84bc1cb8f6123a.mp4?t=1761197150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TL;DR</h2><br><strong>You\u2019re stranded. Everything wants you dead. But you\u2019re not defenseless.</strong><br>Build your base, use the world around you, level up \u2013 and fight your way back to safety.<br><strong>Hexabot Stranded: Defend or Die</strong> blends classic tower defense with real-time action and physics-based gameplay, alone or coop.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846340?t=1761197150","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/12526ec6264ecfaad274605769f3199c6e7873c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761197150","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/632080bf48e8430184fc5e02f6b44a4cfa4278e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761197150","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846340/632080bf48e8430184fc